#─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────-#
#
#	This project uses Docker Secrets for all sensitive values. Secrets are stored
#	in ./secrets/ (git-ignored) and mounted at /run/secrets/ inside each container.
#
#	Run `make secrets` or `bash scripts/setup-secrets.sh` to generate the secret
#	files interactively before first launch.
#
#
#	The secrets created are:
#
#		- secrets/psql_dbname.txt        	// PostgreSQL database name
#		- secrets/psql_admin_user.txt    	// PostgreSQL admin username
#		- secrets/psql_admin_passwd.txt  	// PostgreSQL admin password
#		- secrets/psql_services_passwd.txt	// Shared password for service DB roles
#		- secrets/redis_passwd.txt       	// Redis password
#		- secrets/jwt_access.txt         	// JWT signing secret (auto-generated if left blank)
#		- secrets/ssl/key.pem            	// TLS private key (auto-generated by Makefile)
#		- secrets/ssl/cert.pem           	// TLS certificate (auto-generated by Makefile)
#
#-────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────#


# ── Optional environment variables (all have sensible defaults) ────────────

# Service URLs (used by api-gateway and inter-service calls)
# ────────────
# AUTH_URL=https://auth:3000
# PLAYER_URL=https://player:3001
# CHAT_URL=https://chat:2000
# LOBBY_URL=https://lobby:3003
# GAME_URL=https://game:3002

# API Gateway
# ────────────
# PORT=4000
# CORS_ORIGIN=https://localhost:5173

# Redis (used by stats-worker)
# ────────────
# REDIS_URL=redis://redis:6379
